; etyme.com: the mail records that were NOT carried over when the
; nameservers moved to Vercel (found 2026-11-12: MX none, TXT none).
; Every value below is from the live zone exported on 2026-11-09.
;
; Type each record into Vercel → Domains → etyme.com → DNS Records.
; "@" means leave the Name box empty. Typing them is the safe way: it only
; adds. Do not delete the three records Resend added on 2026-11-11
; (send, rsend, resend._domainkey).

$ORIGIN etyme.com.
$TTL 3600

; ── 1. Receiving: Google Workspace mail for @etyme.com ─────────────────
; The first line alone brings mail back. The other four are Google's
; backups; add all five.
@                     IN  MX  1   aspmx.l.google.com.
@                     IN  MX  5   alt1.aspmx.l.google.com.
@                     IN  MX  5   alt2.aspmx.l.google.com.
@                     IN  MX  10  alt3.aspmx.l.google.com.
@                     IN  MX  10  alt4.aspmx.l.google.com.

; ── 2. Sending: SPF, so mail from @etyme.com is not refused or junked ──
; One SPF record only. Two make SPF fail for every message.
@                     IN  TXT  "v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com ~all"

; ── 3. Later the same day: Google's proof that the domain is yours ─────
@                     IN  TXT  "google-site-verification=BBDibdPX9tTYPhaDsrVgPeKBEqMiCXs8rZjrf4WbfYk"
@                     IN  TXT  "google-site-verification=cxCyQld11ghvCXM09SlUlmD1aVXzandjIVzX9EPXQlc"
@                     IN  TXT  "google-site-verification=hxgsHBmOvl9N-eZ2B67Y-NIuWG2-L0t0SZeDnTrb4z8"

; ── 4. Later: reports only, nothing is rejected ────────────────────────
_dmarc                IN  TXT  "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:support@etyme.com"

; ── 5. Optional: Google Workspace short addresses the old zone had ─────
calendar              IN  CNAME  ghs.google.com.
docs                  IN  CNAME  ghs.google.com.
sites                 IN  CNAME  ghs.google.com.
start                 IN  CNAME  ghs.google.com.
mail                  IN  CNAME  ghs.googlehosted.com.
imap                  IN  CNAME  imap.googlemail.com.
pop                   IN  CNAME  pop.googlemail.com.
smtp                  IN  CNAME  smtp.googlemail.com.
